  "label": "User projected onto the woman as an object of admiration",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman (Tilda Swinton), interpreting her as the subject of the affirmation 'no less beautiful'. The meme format invites the user to identify with the celebratory message directed at the woman, seeing her as a figure worthy of admiration. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the implicit projection is onto the woman as the recipient of the affirmation, making her the focal point of the user's projected admiration.",
